FOUR. Ducks unleashing an onslaught in this second period.

Cutter Gatuhier and AJ Greer on the rush, Gauthier shot, Greer to the rebound, which takes the Vegas goalie well out of the paint, for Leo Carlsson to slam home a 4-0 Anaheim lead.

@SportingTrib | #FlyTogether

Now that's a damn good looking power play.

Puck retrievals, puck movement and the finish. Top unit of LaCombe, Carlsson, Gauthier, Granlund, Sennecke finds paydirt.

@SportingTrib | #FlyTogether

Great play for that fourth line on the forecheck. Washe takes it deep, Caulfield gets physical to hold it up, Washe digs the puck back out to Nesterenko for the finish.

Obviously Washe is a Duck, but good for Caulfield, Nesterenko to make impressions.

@SportingTrib | #FlyTogether
